    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t-note",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 48,
      "text": "at-least-once: XADD to the done stream and XACK are two commands, so a crash between them\nre-delivers the job. A dead worker's entry stays in the PEL and a peer claims it after\nminIdle (5000 ms) \u2014 never XGROUP DELCONSUMER a consumer that still holds entries.",
      "originalText": "at-least-once: XADD to the done stream and XACK are two commands, so a crash between them\nre-delivers the job. A dead worker's entry stays in the PEL and a peer claims it after\nminIdle (5000 ms) \u2014 never XGROUP DELCONSUMER a consumer that still holds entries.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#2D4754",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
